## GF(3) Conservation

Every Hydra query expansion must conserve:
```
Σ trits = 0 (mod 3)
```

Example 3-head query:
- Head 1 (Audit): trit = -1
- Head 2 (Bridge): trit = 0
- Head 3 (Deploy): trit = +1
- Sum: -1 + 0 + 1 = 0 ✓
